# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MITS Smart ID — Frontend Environment Variables (TEMPLATE)
# Copy to .env and fill in real values. NEVER commit .env.
#
# NB: Vite bakes every VITE_*-prefixed value into the client
# bundle at build time. That means these are PUBLIC by design —
# never put real secrets here. Anything server-side belongs in
# the backend .env.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dev proxy: Vite forwards /api/* to the deployed backend (see vite.config.ts)
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
VITE_SOCKET_URL=/

# To target a locally-running backend instead:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:4000

# Google OAuth client ID (public value, safe to commit if you want)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<your-google-oauth-client-id>.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Optional: student portal domain override (matches backend CAMPUS_ENTRY_STUDENT_DOMAIN)
# VITE_CAMPUS_ENTRY_STUDENT_DOMAIN=mitsgwl.ac.in
